${C_CYAN}${C_BOLD}  vicine${C_RESET} ${C_DIM}v${version_number}${C_RESET}  ${C_GRAY}Watch and download movies, series and anime for free${C_RESET}

${C_WHITE}Usage:${C_RESET}
